---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Small Business Website Design | Pixova Birmingham"
  description="Pixova builds fast, SEO-ready websites for small businesses across the UK. Powered by AI, based in Birmingham. No jargon — just a site that gets you found."
  canonicalUrl="https://pixova.uk/"
>
  <link
    slot="head"
    rel="preload" as="image"
    href="/images/hero-anil.webp"
    fetchpriority="high"
  />
  <script slot="head" type="application/ld+json">{JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What does Pixova do?",
        "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Pixova builds fast, SEO-ready websites for small businesses across the UK, handles local SEO to get businesses found on Google, and sets up AI-powered marketing automation so enquiries are followed up automatically. Everything is fully managed — clients don't need any technical knowledge." }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How much does a small business website cost?",
        "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Pixova offers three packages: a Starter Website (a fully managed, SEO-ready site built in around 7 days), a Growth Bundle (website plus monthly SEO and blog content), and a Full Service package (website, SEO, and AI marketing automation). All packages are fully managed with no hidden fees." }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How long does local SEO take to work?",
        "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Local SEO typically takes three to six months before you see consistent results. Google needs time to find, crawl, and trust a new or improved website before ranking it. The results compound over time — a site that ranks keeps ranking without ongoing ad spend." }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What is marketing automation for small businesses?",
        "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Marketing automation means setting up systems that respond to enquiries, follow up with leads, and request reviews automatically — without you doing anything manually. For example: a new enquiry arrives on your website and within two minutes the customer receives a professional acknowledgement email. A lead who doesn't book immediately receives follow-up messages over the next two weeks. A completed job triggers an automatic request for a Google review. These systems are set up once and run indefinitely." }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Can AI automation help a small business get more customers?",
        "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. AI automation helps small businesses respond faster to enquiries (which significantly increases conversion rates), follow up with leads consistently, and handle repetitive tasks like review requests and appointment reminders. Pixova builds these systems as part of the Full Service package — they are set up once and run in the background while you focus on your work." }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Does Pixova work with businesses outside Birmingham?",
        "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Pixova is based in Birmingham but works with small and medium businesses across the whole of the UK. All services — web design, local SEO, and marketing automation — are delivered remotely." }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How quickly can Pixova build my website?",
        "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Pixova's average time to go live is 7 days from the point of starting. The site is built fast using AI-assisted development, then fully managed so clients never need to touch it again." }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What types of businesses does Pixova work with?",
        "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Pixova works with tradespeople (plumbers, electricians, builders, landscapers, roofers), professional services (accountants, solicitors, consultants, financial advisors), and lifestyle and beauty businesses (salons, therapists, personal trainers, studios). Essentially any UK small business that needs to be found on Google and wants its online presence fully managed." }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What is the difference between local SEO and regular SEO?",
        "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Regular SEO tries to rank a website nationally for broad terms. Local SEO focuses on ranking in a specific geographic area — targeting searches like 'plumber Birmingham' or 'accountant Manchester' rather than 'plumber UK'. For most small businesses, local SEO is far more valuable because it targets people in your area who are ready to buy right now." }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Do I need any technical knowledge to work with Pixova?",
        "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "No. Pixova handles everything — building the website, setting up SEO, managing content, and building any automation systems. Clients do not need to know anything technical. The whole point is that it is fully managed so business owners can focus on running their business." }
      }
    ]
  })}</script>

  <!-- HERO ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section
    class="relative overflow-hidden flex items-center"
    style="background-color:#0D2240; min-height:calc(100svh - 64px);"
  >
    <!-- Background orbs -->
    <div class="orb absolute pointer-events-none" style="width:600px; height:600px; top:-120px; right:-140px; border-radius:50%; background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(46,204,154,0.1) 0%, transparent 65%);"></div>
    <div class="orb-2 absolute pointer-events-none" style="width:400px; height:400px; bottom:-80px; left:-100px; border-radius:50%; background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(28,53,87,0.6) 0%, transparent 65%);"></div>


    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 w-full py-16 md:py-20">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-14 items-center">

        <!-- Left: text -->
        <div class="order-2 lg:order-1 hero-animate">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-5">
            <span class="block w-5 h-0.5 rounded" style="background:#2ECC9A;"></span>
            <span class="sec-label">Birmingham · AI-Powered · UK-Wide</span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="font-heading font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl leading-tight mb-5" style="color:#fff; letter-spacing:-0.025em;">
            Small business<br/>websites that<br/>actually <span style="color:#2ECC9A;">get you found.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-lg" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.62);">
            No confusing tech. No overpriced agencies. Just a proper
            website built with AI — managed by us, so your phone rings from Google.
          </p>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-10">
            <a href="/about#contact" class="btn-p" style="box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(46,204,154,0.3);">
              Let's have a chat
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn-g">
              See how it works
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 hero-animate-delay">
            {['UK-based team', 'Live in 7 days', 'Fully managed', 'No long contracts'].map(badge => (
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0" style="background:#2ECC9A;"></span>
                {badge}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: bento card grid -->
        <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 hidden sm:grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 hero-animate-images">

          <!-- Card 1: Photo + enquiries badge -->
          <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden" style="height:260px; grid-column:1; grid-row:1;">
            <img
              src="/images/hero-anil.webp"
              alt="Anil Jaishi, founder of Pixova Birmingham web design agency"
              width="800" height="446"
              loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top"
            />
            <!-- Gradient overlay -->
            <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background:linear-gradient(to top, rgba(13,34,64,0.75) 0%, transparent 55%);"></div>
            <!-- Badge -->
            <div class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 right-3 flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-xl px-3 py-2.5" style="background:rgba(13,34,64,0.85); backdrop-filter:blur(8px); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0" style="background:#2ECC9A;">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0D2240" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-white text-xs font-semibold leading-tight" style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;">Live in 7 days</p>
                <p class="text-xs leading-tight" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);">Not 7 weeks</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 2: Stat card -->
          <div class="rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between" style="background:#fff; height:260px; grid-column:2; grid-row:1;">
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3" style="color:#2ECC9A; letter-spacing:0.1em;">UK-wide reach</p>
              <div class="font-heading font-bold text-5xl leading-none mb-2" style="color:#1C3557; letter-spacing:-0.04em;">100<span style="color:#2ECC9A; font-size:2rem;">%</span></div>
              <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color:#6a8090;">Fully managed — hosting, updates, security. You do nothing.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="h-1 rounded-full mb-1" style="background:#E8F5F1; overflow:hidden;">
                <div class="h-full rounded-full" style="width:100%; background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2ECC9A,#1db37a);"></div>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs" style="color:#a0b0bc;">Managed clients</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 3: Dark chart card (spans full width) -->
          <div class="col-span-2 rounded-2xl p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0D1F2D 0%,#1C3557 100%); height:140px;">
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-2" style="color:#2ECC9A; letter-spacing:0.08em;">SEO &amp; traffic growth</p>
              <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base leading-snug" style="color:#fff;">Your Google rankings,<br/>handled for you.</h3>
            </div>
            <!-- Mini bar chart -->
            <div class="flex items-end gap-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="height:56px;">
              {[25,40,35,28,60,75,65,100].map((h, i) => (
                <div
                  class="rounded-sm"
                  style={`width:12px; height:${h}%; background:${i >= 4 ? '#2ECC9A' : 'rgba(255,255,255,0.15)'};`}
                ></div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Trust bar inside hero -->
      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 relative z-10" style="border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 flex-wrap">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);">Trusted by businesses in</span>
          <div class="w-px h-4 flex-shrink-0" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);"></div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-1">
            {['Birmingham', 'Manchester', 'Leeds', 'Bristol', 'London'].map(city => (
              <span class="font-heading font-bold text-sm" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);">{city}</span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- TESTIMONIAL ─────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="py-10" style="background-color:#E8F5F1;">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="fade-up overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-md flex flex-col md:flex-row" style="border:1px solid rgba(46,204,154,0.15);">

        <!-- Left 70%: Jake's journey -->
        <div class="flex-1 bg-white px-7 py-8">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-5" style="color:#2ECC9A; letter-spacing:0.1em;">Client journey</p>

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-0">

            <!-- Step 1 -->
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0" style="background:#E8F5F1; color:#2ECC9A; border:2px solid #2ECC9A;">1</div>
                <div class="flex-1 w-px my-1" style="background:rgba(46,204,154,0.2); min-height:28px;"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="pb-5">
                <p class="font-semibold text-sm mb-0.5" style="color:#1C3557;">No online presence</p>
                <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color:#6a8090;">Invisible on Google. Relying on word of mouth alone with no way to reach new customers searching online.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 2 -->
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0" style="background:#E8F5F1; color:#2ECC9A; border:2px solid #2ECC9A;">2</div>
                <div class="flex-1 w-px my-1" style="background:rgba(46,204,154,0.2); min-height:28px;"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="pb-5">
                <p class="font-semibold text-sm mb-0.5" style="color:#1C3557;">Pixova built &amp; launched in 7 days</p>
                <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color:#6a8090;">A fast, SEO-ready website live in under a week. Fully managed from day one — Jake didn't touch a thing.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 3 -->
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0" style="background:#2ECC9A; color:#fff; border:2px solid #2ECC9A;">3</div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-sm mb-0.5" style="color:#1C3557;">Phone started ringing from Google</p>
                <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color:#6a8090;">New customers calling within the first month — people who had never heard of him, finding him through search.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right 30%: photo + gold stars + quote -->
        <div class="md:w-56 flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 py-8 text-center" style="background:#1C3557;">
          <!-- Circular photo -->
          <div style="width:76px; height:76px; border-radius:50%; padding:3px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2ECC9A,#1db37a); flex-shrink:0;">
            <img
              src="/images/jake-victor.webp"
              alt="Jake Victor"
              width="70" height="70"
              loading="lazy"
              style="width:100%; height:100%; border-radius:50%; object-fit:cover; object-position:top; display:block; border:3px solid #1C3557;"
            />
          </div>
          <p style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:0.85rem; color:#fff; margin-top:0.6rem; line-height:1.2;">Jake Victor</p>
          <p style="font-size:0.68rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin-bottom:0.8rem;">SEO client · Birmingham</p>

          <!-- Gold stars -->
          <div class="flex gap-0.5 justify-center mb-4">
            {[1,2,3,4,5].map(() => (
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F59E0B" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/>
              </svg>
            ))}
          </div>

          <!-- Quote -->
          <p style="font-size:0.8rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75); line-height:1.65; font-style:italic;">"Honestly the best money we've spent on marketing."</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- WHO WE HELP ─────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-offwhite">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <span class="sec-label reveal">Who we help</span>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl mt-2 reveal reveal-d1" style="color:#1C3557; letter-spacing:-0.025em;">
          We get your world.<br/>Not just websites.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base mt-3 max-w-lg reveal reveal-d2" style="color:#4a6070; line-height:1.7;">
          Whether you're a plumber in Birmingham or an accountant in Manchester — your website should be built around your trade, your area, your customers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Asymmetric bento: big card left, 2 stacked right -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">

        <!-- Big tall card — Tradespeople -->
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden reveal" style="min-height:440px;">
          <img
            src="/images/who-trades.webp"
            alt="Tradespeople web design Birmingham — plumbers, electricians, builders"
            width="800" height="600"
            loading="lazy"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover absolute inset-0"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background:linear-gradient(to top, rgba(13,34,64,0.95) 0%, rgba(13,34,64,0.65) 50%, rgba(13,34,64,0.45) 100%);"></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-7">
            <span class="inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4" style="background:#2ECC9A; color:#0D2240; letter-spacing:0.08em;">Tradespeople</span>
            <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-2xl mb-2 leading-snug" style="color:#fff;">Your phone should ring<br/>from Google.</h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.68);">Plumbers, electricians, builders, landscapers. You're on-site all day. We make Google send you customers without you touching a thing.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right column: 2 stacked cards -->
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">

          <!-- Lifestyle & beauty -->
          <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden reveal reveal-d1 flex-1" style="min-height:200px;">
            <img
              src="/images/who-beauty.webp"
              alt="Beauty and lifestyle business website design UK"
              width="800" height="600"
              loading="lazy"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover absolute inset-0"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background:linear-gradient(to top, rgba(13,34,64,0.82) 0%, rgba(13,34,64,0.2) 55%, transparent 100%);"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-5">
              <span class="inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full mb-3" style="background:rgba(46,204,154,0.15); color:#2ECC9A; border:1px solid rgba(46,204,154,0.3); letter-spacing:0.06em;">Lifestyle &amp; beauty</span>
              <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg leading-snug mb-1" style="color:#fff;">Instagram gets you so far.</h3>
              <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);">A proper website gets you found by people who've never heard of you yet.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Professional services -->
          <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden reveal reveal-d2 flex-1" style="min-height:200px;">
            <img
              src="/images/who-professional.webp"
              alt="Professional services website design — accountants, consultants, solicitors"
              width="800" height="600"
              loading="lazy"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover absolute inset-0"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background:linear-gradient(to top, rgba(13,34,64,0.88) 0%, transparent 60%);"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-5">
              <span class="inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full mb-3" style="background:rgba(46,204,154,0.15); color:#2ECC9A; border:1px solid rgba(46,204,154,0.3); letter-spacing:0.06em;">Professional services</span>
              <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg leading-snug mb-1" style="color:#fff;">You're credible in person.</h3>
              <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);">Your website should say the same. We build authority that works before you've even spoken.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- HOW IT WORKS ────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section id="how-it-works" class="py-20" style="background-color:#0D2240;">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <span class="sec-label reveal">THE PROCESS</span>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl mt-3 reveal reveal-d1" style="color:#fff; letter-spacing:-0.025em;">
          Three steps. Then your phone starts ringing.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">

        {[
          {
            n: '1',
            icon: '<rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><line x1="3" y1="9" x2="21" y2="9"/><line x1="9" y1="21" x2="9" y2="9"/>',
            title: 'We build your website',
            desc: 'SEO ready from the first line of code. Designed to rank, not just to look good. Live within 7 days, not 7 weeks.',
          },
          {
            n: '2',
            icon: '<path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><polyline points="9 12 11 14 15 10"/>',
            title: 'We manage everything',
            desc: 'Updates, hosting, security and changes, all handled by us. You message us what you need. We sort it the same day.',
          },
          {
            n: '3',
            icon: '<circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/>',
            title: 'You get found',
            desc: 'Google starts showing your business to people searching your trade in your area. Your phone rings. You do the work you\'re good at.',
          },
        ].map((step, i) => (
          <div class={`glass-card p-7 relative reveal ${i === 1 ? 'reveal-d1' : i === 2 ? 'reveal-d2' : ''}`}>
            <div class="absolute top-5 right-5 font-heading font-black text-7xl select-none pointer-events-none" style={`color:#fff; opacity:0.04; line-height:1;`}>{step.n}</div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold text-white mb-5" style="background-color:#2ECC9A;">{step.n}</div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4" style="background:rgba(46,204,154,0.12); border:1px solid rgba(46,204,154,0.2);">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2ECC9A" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" set:html={step.icon}/>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-3" style="color:#fff;">{step.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);">{step.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- SERVICES ────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-offwhite">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <span class="sec-label reveal">WHAT WE DO</span>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl mt-2 reveal reveal-d1" style="color:#1C3557; letter-spacing:-0.025em;">
          Everything you need.<br class="hidden sm:block"/> Nothing you don't.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">

        <!-- Starter Website -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex flex-col reveal reveal-d1">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-5" style="background-color:#E8F5F1;">
